"""Checked bilingual local rewrites. Original author proofs are separate source-only records."""
R={}
def add(i,ztitle,etitle,tex,zdefs,edefs,za,ea,steps,role='proof',assessment='no_statement_error_recorded',scope=None):
 R[i]=dict(title=ztitle,title_en=etitle,statement_tex=tex,definitions=(zdefs,edefs),assumptions=(za,ea),steps=steps,role=role,assessment=assessment,scope=scope)
add('bnn-interaction','原始交互与全部掩码重构','Raw dividends reconstruct every mask',r'I_g(S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|T|}g(T),\qquad g(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)',
 r'有限总体为 $N$；固定样本、输入基线后，$g(T)=v(x_T)$、$b=g(\varnothing)$，原 $I(S\mid x)$ 对应 $I_g(S)$。$\Omega\subseteq2^N$ 是允许保留的支持族；完整重构可取全部集合，或包含所有非零系数的族。',
 r'Fix the finite universe $N$, sample and input baseline. Put $g(T)=v(x_T)$ and $b=g(\varnothing)$; source $I(S\mid x)$ is $I_g(S)$. The support family $\Omega\subseteq2^N$ may be the whole powerset or any family containing every nonzero coefficient.',
 '只需有限集合游戏；不要求可微、不要求稀疏，也不要求输出基线为零。','Only a finite set game is required. Differentiability, sparsity and a zero output baseline are unnecessary.',[
 ('交换两层有限子集和','Exchange the two finite subset sums',r'将定义代入：$\sum_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)=\sum_{U\subseteq T}g(U)\sum_{U\subseteq S\subseteq T}(-1)^{|S|-|U|}$。内层对差集 $T\setminus U$ 的子集求交替符号和。',r'Substitution gives $\sum_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)=\sum_{U\subseteq T}g(U)\sum_{U\subseteq S\subseteq T}(-1)^{|S|-|U|}$. The inner alternating sum ranges over subsets of $T\setminus U$.'),
 ('消去真子集并保留空项','Cancel proper subsets and retain the empty term',r'若 $U\ne T$，内层为 $(1-1)^{|T|-|U|}=0$；若 $U=T$，唯一项为1。因此只剩 $g(T)$。特别地 $I_g(\varnothing)=b$，完整和已经包含输出基线。删除零系数不改变和，但是否只有少量非零项是另一问题。',r'For $U\ne T$ the inner sum is $(1-1)^{|T|-|U|}=0$; for $U=T$ its sole term is one. The result is $g(T)$. In particular $I_g(\varnothing)=b$, so the full sum already includes the output baseline. Removing zero coefficients preserves reconstruction, while having only a few nonzero coefficients is a separate claim.')])
add('bnn-taylor','Taylor 支持展开的有效范围','The valid scope of Taylor support expansion',r'I_g(S)=\sum_{\pi:\operatorname{supp}\pi=S}a_\pi\prod_{i\in S}(x_i-r_i)^{\pi_i}',
 r'$r$ 是输入基线向量，$z_i=x_i-r_i$，$\pi\in\mathbb N^N$，$\operatorname{supp}\pi=\{i:\pi_i>0\}$。$a_\pi=D^\pi v(r)/\pi!$。原 $U_{S,\pi}(x\prime)$ 含随输入变动的符号，$J$ 使用绝对增量；两者相乘才是有符号单项式。',
 r'The input baseline is $r$, increments are $z_i=x_i-r_i$, and $\pi\in\mathbb N^N$ has support $\{i:\pi_i>0\}$. Set $a_\pi=D^\pi v(r)/\pi!$. Source $U_{S,\pi}(x\prime)$ contains moving signs, while $J$ uses absolute increments; their product is the signed monomial.',
 '保留原任意神经网络的量词。有效有限子结果采用真实有限多项式；无限级数还需在所有有关掩码上收敛及可合法分组的条件，原文未给。','Retain the source quantifier over arbitrary neural networks. The valid finite component concerns an actual finite polynomial. An infinite series also needs convergence at all relevant masks and legitimate regrouping, which the source does not supply.',[
 ('核查任意网络的原量词','Check the arbitrary-network quantifier',r'取一维 $v(t)=\max(t-1/2,0)$、$r=0$、$x=1$。这是允许的 ReLU 网络，在0附近恒零，全部经典 Taylor 系数为零，但 $I_g(\{1\})=v(1)-v(0)=1/2$。所以原无条件全局展开不是任意 DNN 的恒等式。该完整网络反例为人读证明，机器证据不宣称已形式化 ReLU。',r'Take the allowed one-dimensional ReLU network $v(t)=\max(t-1/2,0)$, baseline $r=0$ and input $x=1$. Every classical Taylor coefficient at zero vanishes, yet $I_g(\{1\})=v(1)-v(0)=1/2$. Thus the unrestricted global expansion fails for arbitrary DNNs. This is a complete human-readable network counterexample; the machine evidence does not formalize the ReLU counterexample.'),
 ('按单项式支持重构','Reconstruct by monomial support',r'对于有限多项式，单项式 $m_\pi(z^T)$ 在 $\operatorname{supp}\pi\subseteq T$ 时等于 $m_\pi(z)$，否则有一个正次数零因子，值为0。将同支持的多个次数分别累加，得到 $g(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T}K_S$。有限 Möbius 唯一性给 $K_S=I_g(S)$，空支持常数也保留。PolynomialSupport 的有限索引允许同一支持有多个不同次数。',r'For a finite polynomial, $m_\pi(z^T)$ equals $m_\pi(z)$ when $\operatorname{supp}\pi\subseteq T$ and vanishes otherwise because one positive-degree factor is zero. Group all degrees with the same support to obtain $g(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T}K_S$. Finite Möbius uniqueness gives $K_S=I_g(S)$, retaining the empty-support constant. The finite index in PolynomialSupport permits several degrees with the same support.')],role='partial_proof_with_refuted_clause',assessment='refuted')
add('bnn-lowest','真实最低阶交互的精确 Gaussian 矩','Exact Gaussian moments of the actual lowest-degree dividend',r'E[I]=U_{\mathrm{ref}},\qquad\operatorname{Var}I=U_{\mathrm{ref}}^2\bigl[(1+\sigma^2/\tau^2)^{|S|}-1\bigr]',
 r'固定非空概念 $S$，$a$ 是最低单项式系数，$x_i-r_i=s_i\tau$、$s_i^2=1$。真实最低交互为 $I(x\prime)=a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)$；$U_{\mathrm{ref}}=a\prod_{i\in S}s_i\tau=I(x)$。模型还允许任意常数输出基线 $b$，其非空交互为零。',
 r'Fix a nonempty concept $S$, lowest-monomial coefficient $a$, and increments $x_i-r_i=s_i\tau$ with $s_i^2=1$. The actual lowest dividend is $I(x\prime)=a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)$, and $U_{\mathrm{ref}}=a\prod_{i\in S}s_i\tau=I(x)$. An arbitrary constant output baseline $b$ is retained; it contributes no nonempty dividend.',
 r'原最低项假设及固定参考距离模型；$\tau\ne0$，坐标扰动独立，$\epsilon_i\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2)$。不把 $U(x\prime)$ 当作跨输入固定的移动符号系数；不截断 Gaussian 尾部。',
 r'Use the source lowest-term hypothesis and fixed reference-distance model, with $\tau\ne0$ and independent $\epsilon_i\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2)$. Do not treat the moving-sign coefficient $U(x\prime)$ as constant across inputs. Gaussian tails are not truncated.',[
 ('从真实掩码提取最低交互','Extract the lowest dividend from actual masks',r'对 $v(x_T\prime)=b+a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)\mathbf1_{i\in T}$ 应用支持律，非空交互恰为 $a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)$。原 $U(x\prime)$ 与 $J_{abs}(x\prime)$ 的两份 sign 幂相乘消去，即使越过基线仍恢复真实有符号多项式。',r'For $v(x_T\prime)=b+a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)\mathbf1_{i\in T}$, the support identity makes the nonempty dividend exactly $a\prod_{i\in S}(x_i\prime-r_i)$. The two sign powers in source $U(x\prime)J_{abs}(x\prime)$ cancel and recover the actual signed polynomial even after crossing the baseline.'),
 ('使用固定参考系数因式分解','Factor using the fixed reference coefficient',r'逐坐标因式分解得到 $I(x+\epsilon)=U_{\mathrm{ref}}\prod_{i\in S}(1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau)$。因为 $s_i^2=1$，Gaussian 映射法则给 $s_i\epsilon_i/\tau\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2/\tau^2)$，独立性在可测坐标变换下保留。该表达式不含绝对值尾部近似。',r'Coordinatewise factorization gives $I(x+\epsilon)=U_{\mathrm{ref}}\prod_{i\in S}(1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau)$. Since $s_i^2=1$, the Gaussian map-law gives $s_i\epsilon_i/\tau\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2/\tau^2)$; measurable coordinate transforms preserve independence. This expression uses no approximation of absolute-value tails.'),
 ('由真实 Gaussian 律计算矩','Compute moments from the actual Gaussian laws',r'每个平移因子有有限二阶矩、均值1、二阶原点矩 $1+\sigma^2/\tau^2$。独立乘积均值为1、二阶原点矩为 $(1+\sigma^2/\tau^2)^{|S|}$。乘上 $U_{\mathrm{ref}}$ 并减去均值平方得原均值与方差。$U_{\mathrm{ref}}=0$ 与 $\sigma=0$ 均可，未做除以这些量的操作。',r'Each shifted factor has finite second moment, mean one and raw second moment $1+\sigma^2/\tau^2$. Independence gives product mean one and raw second moment $(1+\sigma^2/\tau^2)^{|S|}$. Scaling by $U_{\mathrm{ref}}$ and subtracting the mean square yields the source moments. $U_{\mathrm{ref}}=0$ and $\sigma=0$ are allowed because neither is divided out.')])
add('bnn-product','独立乘积的真实积分矩','Actual integral moments of an independent product',r'E\prod_iX_i=\prod_iEX_i,\qquad\operatorname{Var}\prod_iX_i=\prod_i[(EX_i)^2+\operatorname{Var}X_i]-\prod_i(EX_i)^2',
 r'$X_i$ 是同一概率空间上的有限独立随机变量族。均值与方差是 Lebesgue 积分；方差定义为 $E(X_i-EX_i)^2$。',r'The $X_i$ form a finite independent family on one probability space. Means and variances are Lebesgue integrals, with variance $E(X_i-EX_i)^2$.',
 '数学式在有限一、二阶矩范围解释；论文实际 Gaussian 整数幂因子满足这些条件，ConceptGaussian 从分布律证明，而非将矩公式作为假设。','Interpret the formulas where the first and second moments are finite. The paper’s Gaussian integer-power factors satisfy these conditions, which ConceptGaussian proves from their distribution laws.',[
 ('分别分解一次与二次乘积积分','Factor the first and second product integrals',r'可测独立变量的乘积积分分解给 $E\prod_iX_i=\prod_iEX_i$。平方后的族仍独立；有限 L2 因子及其独立乘积具有所需可积性，故 $E(\prod_iX_i)^2=\prod_iEX_i^2$。',r'Factorization for measurable independent variables gives $E\prod_iX_i=\prod_iEX_i$. The squared family remains independent. Finite L2 factors and their independent product supply the required integrability, so $E(\prod_iX_i)^2=\prod_iEX_i^2$.'),
 ('减去均值平方并适配 Gaussian 幂','Subtract the mean square and adapt Gaussian powers',r'代入 $EX_i^2=(EX_i)^2+\operatorname{Var}X_i$，再减去 $(E\prod_iX_i)^2=\prod_i(EX_i)^2$。本篇 $X_i=|1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i}$；Gaussian 任意有限 Lp 矩通过幂变换给每个因子 L2，因此原概率模型所需条件被实际满足。',r'Substitute $EX_i^2=(EX_i)^2+\operatorname{Var}X_i$ and subtract $(E\prod_iX_i)^2=\prod_i(EX_i)^2$. Here $X_i=|1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i}$. Arbitrary finite Gaussian Lp moments and the power transform give L2 for each factor, discharging the required premises in the paper’s model.')])
add('bnn-general-moments','绝对触发与有符号矩的区别','Absolute triggers and signed moments differ',r'J=\prod_{i\in S}|1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i},\quad E J=\prod_i E|1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i}',
 r'$S$ 是非空概念支持，$\pi_i\in\mathbb N^+$ 在支持内。原 $J$ 含 $\operatorname{sign}(x_i\prime-r_i)(x_i\prime-r_i)=|x_i\prime-r_i|$，而比较的有符号因子是 $Z_i=1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau$。设 $m_i=E|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$、$d_i=\operatorname{Var}|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$。',r'The nonempty concept has positive integer degrees on its support. Source $J$ contains $\operatorname{sign}(x_i\prime-r_i)(x_i\prime-r_i)=|x_i\prime-r_i|$, while its signed comparison factor is $Z_i=1+s_i\epsilon_i/\tau$. Put $m_i=E|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$ and $d_i=\operatorname{Var}|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$.',
 r'独立未截断 Gaussian 扰动与固定非零参考距离。保留原任意正整数次数；作者明确忽略极低概率越界，但没有给精确尾误差界。',r'Use independent untruncated Gaussian noise and a fixed nonzero reference distance. Retain arbitrary positive integer degrees. The author explicitly neglects low-probability baseline crossing, without an exact tail-error bound.',[
 ('恢复原绝对触发的精确矩','Recover exact moments of the original absolute trigger',r'逐坐标 $J=\prod_i|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$。Gaussian 幂的有限二阶矩由实际分布律给出。独立乘积公式得 $EJ=\prod_im_i$、$\operatorname{Var}J=\prod_i(m_i^2+d_i)-\prod_im_i^2$。若全部次数为偶数，绝对幂与有符号幂逐点相等，原替换在这个子域精确成立。',r'Coordinatewise, $J=\prod_i|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$. Actual Gaussian laws give finite second moments of all powers. Independent-product formulas yield $EJ=\prod_im_i$ and $\operatorname{Var}J=\prod_i(m_i^2+d_i)-\prod_im_i^2$. If all degrees are even, absolute and signed powers agree pointwise, so the source replacement is exact on that subdomain.'),
 ('用原一坐标触发给精确反例','Give an exact counterexample using the original one-coordinate trigger',r'取 $x=1,r=0,\tau=1,\pi=1,\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,q)$、$q>0$。原触发为 $J=|1+\epsilon|$；$E(1+\epsilon)=1$，而 $E|1+\epsilon|=1+2E[-(1+\epsilon)\mathbf1_{\epsilon<-1}]>1$，因为非退化 Gaussian 在该半轴有正密度。机器证明通过 Gaussian 与 Lebesgue 的双向绝对连续性及连续非零的 $|z|-z$ 证明严格差。平方逐点相同，故真实方差 $1+q-(E|1+\epsilon|)^2<q$，也不同于有符号方差。',r'Take $x=1,r=0,\tau=1,\pi=1$ and $\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,q)$ with $q>0$. The original trigger is $J=|1+\epsilon|$. The signed mean is $E(1+\epsilon)=1$, while $E|1+\epsilon|=1+2E[-(1+\epsilon)\mathbf1_{\epsilon<-1}]>1$ because a nondegenerate Gaussian has positive density there. The machine proof uses mutual absolute continuity with Lebesgue measure and the continuous nonzero function $|z|-z$ to establish the strict difference. The squares agree pointwise, so the actual variance $1+q-(E|1+\epsilon|)^2<q$ also differs from the signed variance.'),
 ('区分真实交互与绝对触发','Distinguish the actual dividend from its absolute trigger',r'此反例针对 Theorem2.3 的 $J$，不反驳 Theorem2.2 的真实最低交互。后者移动符号系数与绝对触发的符号相消，可以精确改写为固定参考系数乘有符号积；前者仅有绝对触发，没有该相消。将尾部忽略作为近似不能把两个精确矩设为相同。',r'This counterexample concerns $J$ in Theorem 2.3, not the actual lowest dividend in Theorem 2.2. In the latter, moving-sign coefficients cancel the trigger signs, giving the exact fixed-reference signed product. The absolute trigger alone has no such cancellation. Neglecting tails as an approximation does not make the two exact moments equal.')],role='partial_proof_with_refuted_clause',assessment='refuted')
add('bnn-growth','原绝对触发的嵌套支持增长','Nested-support growth of the original absolute trigger',r'\frac{\operatorname{Var}J_{S\prime}}{\operatorname{Var}J_S}>\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}(EZ_i^{\pi_i\prime})^2\ge1,\quad\frac{K_{S\prime}}{K_S}<\frac1{\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}EZ_i^{\pi_i\prime}}\le1',
 r'$S\subsetneq S\prime$，旧坐标次数不变。$A=J_S$、$B=\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}|Z_i|^{\pi_i\prime}$、$J_{S\prime}=AB$，$Z_i\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$、$q=\sigma^2/\tau^2$。$K_T=|EJ_T|/\operatorname{Var}J_T$，分母是方差而不是标准差。',r'Let $S\subsetneq S\prime$ with unchanged old-coordinate degrees. Set $A=J_S$, $B=\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}|Z_i|^{\pi_i\prime}$ and $J_{S\prime}=AB$, where $Z_i\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$ and $q=\sigma^2/\tau^2$. Stability is $K_T=|EJ_T|/\operatorname{Var}J_T$, with variance rather than standard deviation in the denominator.',
 r'原独立 Gaussian、正整数支持次数和包含关系保留。原比值的有定义域要求 $S\ne\varnothing$、$\sigma>0$ 及非零距离；实际 adapter 使用 $\tau>0$。零噪声或空旧支持使方差分母为零，单列定义域缺口，不把有效主干判为错误。',r'Retain the source independent Gaussian model, positive support degrees and inclusion relation. The ordinary defined ratio domain requires nonempty $S$, positive noise and nonzero distance; the actual adapter uses $\tau>0$. Zero noise or an empty old support yields a zero variance denominator, recorded separately without refuting the valid main comparison.',[
 ('从 Gaussian 律证明矩下界与非退化','Prove moment lower bounds and nondegeneracy from Gaussian laws',r'对 $Z\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$，反射 $Z\mapsto2-Z$ 同律。二项式展开中 $z^k+(2-z)^k\ge2$：令 $t=z-1$，奇次项相消、偶次项非负，常数项为2。积分得 $EZ^k\ge1$；逐点 $|z|^k\ge z^k$ 给 $E|Z|^k\ge EZ^k\ge1$。任意 Gaussian 整数幂均 L2。若 $q>0,k>0$ 且绝对幂方差为零，则它几乎处处为常数；其每个水平集最多两个点，与 Gaussian 无原子矛盾，故方差严格正。独立乘积公式继而给非空积的正方差。',r'For $Z\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$, reflection $Z\mapsto2-Z$ preserves the law. The binomial expansion gives $z^k+(2-z)^k\ge2$: with $t=z-1$, odd terms cancel, even terms are nonnegative and the constant term is two. Integration yields $EZ^k\ge1$. Pointwise $|z|^k\ge z^k$ gives $E|Z|^k\ge EZ^k\ge1$. Every Gaussian integer power is L2. If $q>0,k>0$ and the absolute power had zero variance, it would be almost surely constant. Each level set contains at most two points, contradicting the absence of Gaussian atoms. Its variance is therefore positive; the independent-product formula gives positive variance for every nonempty product.'),
 ('按独立新增坐标精确分解方差','Decompose variance using independent added coordinates',r'记 $a=EA$、$b_B=EB$、$v_A=\operatorname{Var}A$、$v_B=\operatorname{Var}B$。支持不交且坐标独立给 $EAB=ab_B$ 与 $\operatorname{Var}(AB)=v_A(b_B^2+v_B)+a^2v_B$。在上述域 $a\ge1,b_B\ge1,v_A>0,v_B>0$，所以 $\operatorname{Var}(AB)/v_A>b_B^2$。令 $p=\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}EZ_i^{\pi_i\prime}$，有 $b_B\ge p\ge1$，从而原方差下界成立。原 Theorem2.3 的错误精确矩替换不再作为推理前提。',r'Write $a=EA$, $b_B=EB$, $v_A=\operatorname{Var}A$ and $v_B=\operatorname{Var}B$. Disjoint supports and independent coordinates give $EAB=ab_B$ and $\operatorname{Var}(AB)=v_A(b_B^2+v_B)+a^2v_B$. On the stated domain, $a\ge1,b_B\ge1,v_A>0,v_B>0$, so $\operatorname{Var}(AB)/v_A>b_B^2$. For $p=\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}EZ_i^{\pi_i\prime}$, we have $b_B\ge p\ge1$, proving the source variance lower bound. The incorrect exact moment replacement in Theorem 2.3 is not used as a premise.'),
 ('计算两个稳定度之比并审查边界','Compute the stability ratio and check boundaries',r'由于期望均正，$K_{S\prime}/K_S=b_Bv_A/\operatorname{Var}(AB)<1/b_B\le1/p\le1$。实际 Lean 用整个旧/新增坐标 Gaussian 家族的积分证明两项不等式，所有正方差与矩下界均已由分布律消去，不假设待证结论。$S=\varnothing$ 时 $J_S=1$，$\sigma=0$ 时全部触发恒1；原比值均含0分母。源文未给该边界的实数约定，因此不将 Lean 的总除法零值作为作者约定。',r'All means are positive, so $K_{S\prime}/K_S=b_Bv_A/\operatorname{Var}(AB)<1/b_B\le1/p\le1$. Actual Lean integrals of the complete old/added Gaussian coordinate family prove both inequalities, with positive variances and moment lower bounds discharged from distribution laws. If $S=\varnothing$, then $J_S=1$; if $\sigma=0$, all triggers equal one. Both cases give zero denominators. The source supplies no ordinary-real convention there, and Lean’s total division is not treated as an author convention.')],role='partial_component',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-regression','独立特征回归的真实全局最优','The actual global optimum of independent-feature regression',r'w_i^*=\frac{y^*}{1+\sum_j a_j^2/d_j}\frac{a_i}{d_i},\quad a_i=EC_i,\quad d_i=\operatorname{Var}C_i',
 r'有限索引 $i$ 对应作者概念 $S$，$C_i$ 是固定的随机特征函数，$w_i$ 对应作者优化变量 $U_S$，$y^*$ 是固定标签。$a,d,w\in\mathbb R^k$；矩阵 $K=\operatorname{diag}d+aa^\top$。$L(w)=E(y^*-\sum_iw_iC_i)^2$ 是原期望平方损失。',r'The finite index $i$ corresponds to a source concept $S$. Each $C_i$ is a fixed random feature, $w_i$ is source optimization variable $U_S$, and $y^*$ is the fixed label. Vectors $a,d,w\in\mathbb R^k$ give matrix $K=\operatorname{diag}d+aa^\top$. The source expected squared loss is $L(w)=E(y^*-\sum_iw_iC_i)^2$.',
 r'保留原明确假设的两两特征独立性，要求原均值/方差有定义；有定义的比例式需要 $d_i>0$。不从“概念重叠通常小”推出独立；分析中固定 $C_i$，不将其依赖的 Taylor 系数与权重一起重新优化。',r'Retain the explicitly assumed pairwise feature independence and the defined first and second moments. The ordinary ratio domain requires $d_i>0$. Small typical concept overlap does not prove independence. Features remain fixed during this analysis; their Taylor coefficients are not reoptimized together with the weights.',[
 ('将真实损失展开为均值误差与方差罚项','Expand the actual loss into mean error and variance penalty',r'中心化 $\eta_i=C_i-a_i$，两两独立性与有限 L2 给 $E\eta_i=0$ 和交叉协方差0。于是 $L(w)=(y^*-a^\top w)^2+\sum_i d_iw_i^2=(y^*)^2+w^\top Kw-2y^*a^\top w$。这是原随机特征的积分恒等式，不预设正规方程。',r'Center $\eta_i=C_i-a_i$. Pairwise independence and finite L2 give $E\eta_i=0$ and zero cross-covariances. Thus $L(w)=(y^*-a^\top w)^2+\sum_i d_iw_i^2=(y^*)^2+w^\top Kw-2y^*a^\top w$. This is an integral identity for the actual random features, not an assumed normal equation.'),
 ('验证显式候选与正定性','Verify the explicit candidate and positive definiteness',r'$d_i>0$ 时对任意非零 $h$，$h^\top Kh=\sum_id_ih_i^2+(a^\top h)^2>0$。设 $t=\sum_i a_i^2/d_i\ge0$、$\lambda=y^*/(1+t)$，令 $w_i^*=\lambda a_i/d_i$。直接计算 $a^\top w^*=\lambda t$，故 $(Kw^*)_i=d_iw_i^*+a_i(a^\top w^*)=a_i\lambda(1+t)=y^*a_i$。无需 Cramer 行列式的省略步骤。',r'If $d_i>0$, every nonzero $h$ satisfies $h^\top Kh=\sum_id_ih_i^2+(a^\top h)^2>0$. Put $t=\sum_i a_i^2/d_i\ge0$, $\lambda=y^*/(1+t)$ and $w_i^*=\lambda a_i/d_i$. Directly, $a^\top w^*=\lambda t$, so $(Kw^*)_i=d_iw_i^*+a_i(a^\top w^*)=a_i\lambda(1+t)=y^*a_i$. No omitted Cramer-determinant argument is needed.'),
 ('完成平方证明唯一最优并保留零方差缺口','Complete the square and retain the zero-variance boundary',r'$L(w)-L(w^*)=(w-w^*)^\top K(w-w^*)>0$ 对 $w\ne w^*$ 成立，因此显式解是唯一全局最优，而非仅驻点。绝对值给 $|w_i^*|=|\lambda||a_i/d_i|$，正是共同尺度比例。若两个允许特征都恒1且 $y^*=1$，损失为 $(1-w_1-w_2)^2$，整条直线都最优，而原 $a_i/d_i$ 是1/0；源未排该域，不用严格正方差修订冒充无条件结论。',r'For $w\ne w^*$, completing the square gives $L(w)-L(w^*)=(w-w^*)^\top K(w-w^*)>0$. The candidate is the unique global optimum, rather than merely stationary. Taking absolute values yields $|w_i^*|=|\lambda||a_i/d_i|$, the stated common-scale proportionality. If two allowed features are constantly one and $y^*=1$, then $L(w)=(1-w_1-w_2)^2$ and a whole line minimizes it, while source $a_i/d_i$ is 1/0. This omitted domain is retained; the strictly positive-variance result does not replace an unrestricted claim.')],role='partial_component',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-scaling','固定参考系数的精确稳定度界','Exact stability bounds for fixed reference coefficients',r'A_{\min}\frac{|EI|}{\operatorname{Var}I}\le\frac{|EC|}{\operatorname{Var}C}\le A_{\max}\frac{|EI|}{\operatorname{Var}I}',
 r'$I=UC$，$U=I(S\mid x)$ 是固定参考系数；$A_{\min}$、$A_{\max}$ 是所比较概念族的最小/最大 $|U|$。$C$ 为随机触发，$I$ 为同一随机触发的常数倍。',r'Write $I=UC$, with fixed reference coefficient $U=I(S\mid x)$. Bounds $A_{\min},A_{\max}$ are the minimum/maximum $|U|$ in the compared concept family. Random dividend $I$ is the constant multiple of the same random trigger $C$.',
 r'原比值的普通实数域：$U\ne0$、$\operatorname{Var}C>0$，并保留 $A_{\min}\le|U|\le A_{\max}$。族为空时极值也需约定；原文没有将这些边界全部排除。',r'The ordinary-real ratio domain has $U\ne0$ and $\operatorname{Var}C>0$, with $A_{\min}\le|U|\le A_{\max}$. An empty family also requires an extremum convention; the source does not exclude every boundary.',[
 ('计算同一随机量的尺度关系','Compute the scaling relation for the same random variable',r'线性积分与方差缩放给 $EI=U EC$、$\operatorname{Var}I=U^2\operatorname{Var}C$。在非零分母域约去一份 $|U|$，得到 $|EC|/\operatorname{Var}C=|U|\,|EI|/\operatorname{Var}I$。这个关系只对固定参考 $U$ 成立，不对随输入改变的 Taylor 符号系数逐次取常数。',r'Integral linearity and variance scaling give $EI=U EC$ and $\operatorname{Var}I=U^2\operatorname{Var}C$. On the nonzero-denominator domain, cancellation yields $|EC|/\operatorname{Var}C=|U|\,|EI|/\operatorname{Var}I$. This uses a fixed reference $U$, rather than treating a moving Taylor sign coefficient as constant.'),
 ('乘上非负比值获得两端界','Multiply the nonnegative ratio to obtain both bounds',r'$|EI|/\operatorname{Var}I\ge0$，因此将 $A_{\min}\le|U|\le A_{\max}$ 乘上该比值并代入尺度恒等式，得到原两端界。若 $U=0$ 则 $I$ 恒零且其方差为零；若触发恒定也有零方差，原式无定义。机器证明明确保留这些条件，没有借总除法约定掩盖边界。',r'The ratio $|EI|/\operatorname{Var}I$ is nonnegative. Multiply $A_{\min}\le|U|\le A_{\max}$ by it and substitute the scaling identity to obtain both source bounds. If $U=0$, the dividend is identically zero and has zero variance; a constant trigger also has zero variance. The original ratios are undefined there. The machine proof records these conditions rather than hiding the boundary with total division.')],role='partial_component',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-binary','实际掩码的二值触发及零系数域','Binary triggers of actual masks and zero reference coefficients',r'C_S(x_T)=\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}\quad\text{when }I_g(S)\ne0',
 r'固定原始游戏 $g$ 与参考样本，$g_T(L)=g(L\cap T)$ 对应再遮罩样本；$U_S=I_g(S)$、$C_S(x_T)=I_{g_T}(S)/U_S$。原 unmask 的AND值也是 $\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}$。',r'Fix the raw reference game $g$. The further-masked sample has game $g_T(L)=g(L\cap T)$, reference weight $U_S=I_g(S)$ and trigger $C_S(x_T)=I_{g_T}(S)/U_S$. The source AND of unmask indicators is $\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}$.',
 '只在原比值有定义的非零参考交互域使用；这个有限掩码结论不需要无限 Taylor 收敛，原 Taylor 比值定义的上游问题另保留。','Use the nonzero reference-dividend domain of the original ratio. This finite mask result needs no infinite Taylor convergence; the separate upstream Taylor-definition issue remains recorded.',[
 ('先证明掩码交互的精确支持律','First prove exact support of masked dividends',r'若 $S\subseteq T$，计算 $I(S)$ 所需的每个 $L\subseteq S$ 都满足 $L\cap T=L$，交互不变。否则取 $i\in S\setminus T$；再掩码游戏插入 $i$ 不改变任何子集输出。有限差分的 dummy 消去使 $I_{g_T}(S)=0$。所以 $I_{g_T}(S)=\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)$，包括原非零输出基线。',r'If $S\subseteq T$, every $L\subseteq S$ used in the dividend satisfies $L\cap T=L$, so the dividend is unchanged. Otherwise choose $i\in S\setminus T$. Inserting $i$ changes no output of the further-masked game, and finite-difference dummy cancellation gives $I_{g_T}(S)=0$. Thus $I_{g_T}(S)=\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)$, preserving any nonzero output baseline.'),
 ('在有定义范围归一化并定位原短证明','Normalize on the defined domain and locate the source argument',r'当 $U_S\ne0$，除以 $U_S$ 得二值触发，所有保留变量的AND判定与源PDF7 Section2.4短证明一致。常数网络的所有非空 $U_S=0$；作者比值此时为0/0，不能约去成1。源G.1是Taylor支持依赖，实际“Only when all…If any…”二值论证在正文第7页，二者出处明确区分。',r'When $U_S\ne0$, dividing by it gives the binary trigger and agrees with the source AND criterion in the short Section 2.4 argument on PDF page 7. A constant network has zero reference weights for every nonempty concept, making the source ratio 0/0 rather than one. G.1 supplies a Taylor-support dependency; the actual “Only when all…If any…” argument is on main-text page 7. Their locations are kept distinct.')],role='partial_component',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-linear-representation','固定参考系数的连续线性表示','Continuous linear representation with fixed reference coefficients',r'v(x\prime)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}U_SC_S(x\prime),\quad C_S(x\prime)=I(S\mid x\prime)/U_S',
 r'$h(T)=v(x_T\prime)$ 是当前输入的原始游戏；$U_S=I(S\mid x)$ 属于固定参考输入。$\Omega$ 必须包含当前输入的全部非零交互，空项 $I_h(\varnothing)=b$ 不能自动删去。',r'The current raw game is $h(T)=v(x_T\prime)$, while $U_S=I(S\mid x)$ belongs to the fixed reference input. The family $\Omega$ must contain every nonzero current dividend, including the empty term $I_h(\varnothing)=b$.',
 '源使用Taylor比值作触发；有效有限适配用真实当前交互除以非零参考系数。源未排除参考交互为零，也未给对所有新输入都能用固定稀疏族的保证。','The source uses a Taylor-ratio trigger. The valid finite adaptation divides actual current dividends by nonzero reference coefficients. Zero reference dividends and the use of a fixed sparse family for every new input are not excluded or justified by the source.',[
 ('在同一当前游戏使用完整重构','Use complete reconstruction of the current game',r'有限重构给 $v(x\prime)=h(N)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}I_h(S)$。如果 $\Omega$ 包含所有非零当前交互，可删除其他零项；这是支持条件，不是仅由参考样本的经验显著性推出。原正文第7页由Eq4和触发解释导出Eq14，须保留此作者短论证。',r'Finite reconstruction gives $v(x\prime)=h(N)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}I_h(S)$. If $\Omega$ contains every nonzero current dividend, the remaining zero terms can be removed. This support condition does not follow merely from empirical salience at the reference sample. Main-text page 7 derives Eq. (14) from Eq. (4) and the trigger interpretation; that source argument is retained.'),
 ('逐项约去参考系数并区分模型固定性','Cancel reference coefficients term by term and distinguish fixed features',r'当每个所用 $U_S\ne0$，定义 $C_S(x\prime)=I_h(S)/U_S$，每项 $U_SC_S=I_h(S)$，代入即得线性表示。若原Taylor求和合法，此比值与作者式一致；若不合法，不能用Lemma2.1错误全局等式补该缺口。回归中还需把这些 $C_S$ 作为固定特征，而不是允许随被优化的 $U_S$ 同步变化。',r'For nonzero used $U_S$, define $C_S(x\prime)=I_h(S)/U_S$, so $U_SC_S=I_h(S)$ termwise. Substitution gives the linear representation. A legitimate Taylor sum agrees with this source ratio, but the invalid unrestricted equality in Lemma 2.1 cannot repair an illegitimate expansion. Regression additionally holds these $C_S$ fixed rather than letting them vary together with the optimized $U_S$.')],role='partial_component',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-salient-matching','显著近似中的激活与误差范围','Activation and error scope of salient approximation',r'R(T)=g(T)-\sum_{S\in\Omega_{salient}}I_g(S)=\sum_{S\subseteq T,S\notin\Omega_{salient}}I_g(S)-\sum_{S\in\Omega_{salient},S\not\subseteq T}I_g(S)',
 r'$\Omega_{salient}$ 按参考输入交互强度筛选；$R(T)$ 是原Eq5未带激活条件的真实残差。与其不同的正确激活近似只求 $S\subseteq T$。',r'The family $\Omega_{salient}$ is selected by reference dividend strength. Residual $R(T)$ belongs to printed Eq. (5), whose sum lacks the activation condition. The activated approximation instead sums only $S\subseteq T$.',
 '原文仅称残差“小”，未给统一范数界或量化误差常数；保留原式而不擅自补S⊆T成为作者陈述。','The source calls the residual small without a uniform norm bound or quantified constant. The printed expression is retained rather than silently inserting S⊆T into the author statement.',[
 ('分离遗漏激活项与错误纳入的未激活项','Separate omitted activated terms and included inactive terms',r'将完整重构按 $S\in\Omega_{salient}$ 分组，再减去原不带 $S\subseteq T$ 的和，得到陈述中的两项残差。三角不等式只给两组绝对尾和上界；逐项阈值不自动保证该总和小。',r'Partition complete reconstruction by membership in $\Omega_{salient}$ and subtract the printed sum without $S\subseteq T$. This gives the two residual sums in the statement. The triangle inequality bounds their absolute tails; an individual threshold does not automatically make the total small.'),
 ('用空掩码定位缺少激活的影响','Use the empty mask to locate the missing activation effect',r'取 $v(t)=ct$、$r=0,x=1$、显著族仅含单变量概念且 $c>0$。空掩码输出0，而原显著和为c，残差为−c；c可任意大。由于作者没有定义“小”的具体界，该例定位漏激活的影响，不冒充对某个已量化概率误差定理的反驳。使用激活条件后的尾和是另列的有效有限推导。',r'Take $v(t)=ct$, baseline $r=0,x=1$, and a salient family containing the singleton, with $c>0$. The empty-mask output is zero, while the printed salient sum is c and its residual is −c, which can be arbitrarily large. Since “small” has no quantified source bound, this example locates the missing activation effect rather than refuting an invented probability-error theorem. The activated tail identity is a separately stated valid finite derivation.')],role='statement_scope_explanation',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-multiorder-link','交互与上下文差分的精确关系','Exact connection between dividends and context differences',r'\Delta_{ij}g(T)=\sum_{L\subseteq T}I_g(L\cup\{i,j\})',
 r'$i\ne j$ 且 $T\cap\{i,j\}=\varnothing$；$\Delta_{ij}g(T)=g(T\cup\{i,j\})-g(T\cup\{i\})-g(T\cup\{j\})+g(T)$。上下文基数 $m=|T|$ 与交互概念阶数 $|L|+2$ 不同。',r'Assume distinct i,j and a context T disjoint from them. Define $\Delta_{ij}g(T)=g(T\cup\{i,j\})-g(T\cup\{i\})-g(T\cup\{j\})+g(T)$. Context cardinality m=|T| differs from dividend order |L|+2.',
 'Appendix D外引“基本分量”的范围；完整有限差分恒等式只需上述集合条件。原文没有由该代数式证明高阶概念必然更易受对抗攻击。','This makes precise the “elementary component” claim cited in Appendix D. The finite difference identity requires only the stated set conditions. The source does not derive universal high-order adversarial vulnerability from this algebra.',[
 ('对四个输出使用同一个原始游戏重构','Reconstruct the four outputs of the same raw game',r'各项替换为交互子集和。既不含i也不含j的系数权重为1−1−1+1=0；只含一个变量的权重也为0；同时含i,j的系数只在首项出现，权重1。它们唯一写成 $L\cup\{i,j\}$、$L\subseteq T$，得到精确关系。任意输出基线包含在首类并消去。',r'Replace each output by its dividend subset sum. A coefficient containing neither i nor j has weight 1−1−1+1=0, and a coefficient containing only one also cancels. Coefficients containing both occur only in the first term with weight one. They are uniquely $L\cup\{i,j\}$ for L⊆T, giving the identity. Any output baseline cancels with the first class.'),
 ('保留外引经验推论的限制','Retain the limit of the cited empirical inference',r'对固定大小的上下文平均会得到多阶交互的相应加权和，因此Harsanyi项确为其代数分量。但一个m阶上下文包含多个不同概念阶数，不能把图5的m坐标直接当成本篇|S|，也不能由代数组合自动转移每个概念的对抗脆弱性结论。',r'Averaging over fixed-size contexts gives the corresponding weighted combination of dividends, so Harsanyi terms are algebraic components. A context of size m includes several different concept orders. Figure 5’s m coordinate is therefore not automatically this paper’s |S|, and the algebra alone does not transfer an adversarial-vulnerability conclusion to each concept.')])
add('bnn-sparsity','外引稀疏概念的范围','Scope of the cited sparse-concept claim',r'\Omega_{salient}=\{S:|I_g(S)|\text{ exceeds a stated threshold}\},\qquad |\Omega_{salient}|\ll2^n\text{ empirically}',
 r'显著族由固定样本交互强度筛选；“稀疏”指相对全部 $2^n$ 个支持只保留少量。正文分别引用faithfulness、稀疏AND表示以及图1的概念出现现象。Appendix B是已有研究综述，不包含本地七性质列表。',r'The salient family is selected by dividend strength at a fixed sample. Sparsity means a small family relative to all 2^n supports. The main text separately cites faithfulness, sparse AND representations and the emergence observed in Figure 1. Appendix B reviews prior work and contains no local seven-property list.',
 '保留作者“通常”与外引语境；本篇没有陈述逐游戏的明确稀疏界及其完整技术前提。','Retain the author’s “usually” and cited context. This paper states no explicit per-game sparsity bound with all technical premises.',[
 ('区分完整重构和少量显著支持','Distinguish complete reconstruction from few salient supports',r'完整有限重构是对每个游戏成立的代数式。正文第3页的稀疏出现主要通过图1对各种网络验证，另引用相关研究的条件结果。Appendix B讨论已有定义与证明来源，不能把这些来源自动当成本篇任意DNN的无前提定理。',r'Complete finite reconstruction is algebra valid for every game. Sparse emergence on page 3 is mainly checked across networks in Figure 1, alongside cited conditional results. Appendix B discusses prior definitions and proof sources; these do not automatically establish an unconditional theorem for arbitrary DNNs here.'),
 ('检验重构不能单独推出稀疏','Check that reconstruction alone does not imply sparsity',r'给全部非空S系数1并重构，得到全部 $2^n-1$ 项非零的有限游戏，可由多线性多项式实现。这只说明重构本身不足以推出稀疏，不反驳带额外前提的外引定理。缺少本地技术前提及完整外引适配时，保持范围审查，不报整条机器定理完成。',r'Assign one to every nonempty coefficient and reconstruct a finite game, realized by a multilinear polynomial. All $2^n-1$ terms are nonzero. This shows only that reconstruction does not imply sparsity; it does not refute a cited theorem with additional premises. With local technical premises and a complete cited adaptation absent, the claim remains under scope review and is not reported as a whole machine theorem.')],role='statement_scope_explanation',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-posterior','均场变分后验与逐层替代模型','Mean-field variational posterior and layerwise surrogate',r'\theta^*=\arg\min_\theta\mathrm{KL}[q_\theta(W)\Vert p(W\mid D)],\quad p(y\mid x)=E_{W\sim q_\theta}p(y\mid x,W)',
 r'$W$ 收集网络权重，$q_\theta(W)=\mathcal N(W;\mu,\Sigma)$，$\Sigma$ 对角、$\theta=(\mu,\Sigma)$；$D$ 为训练集。替代标准DNN参数 $\psi$ 取BNN权重与偏置均值；其输入及低层特征另加独立对角Gaussian扰动。',r'Collect weights in W, with $q_\theta(W)=\mathcal N(W;\mu,\Sigma)$, diagonal covariance and $\theta=(\mu,\Sigma)$. D is the training dataset. The surrogate standard-DNN parameters ψ use mean BNN weights and biases; its input and lower-layer features receive separate diagonal Gaussian perturbations.',
 '原研究明确限于均场变分BNN；其他BNN、Monte Carlo dropout不在此模型的范围。','The source explicitly limits its model to mean-field variational BNNs. Other BNNs and Monte Carlo dropout are outside that scope.',[
 ('写出变分目标与预测积分','State the variational objective and prediction integral',r'原Eq1将后验KL等价写成 $-E_{W\sim q_\theta}\log p(D\mid W)+\mathrm{KL}[q_\theta(W)\Vert p(W)]$ 的优化，省略与θ无关的证据常数。Eq2按权重后验平均预测概率；实验以十个权重采样网络近似该积分。输入基线r和输出基线b不等于权重均值μ。',r'Eq. (1) optimizes $-E_{W\sim q_\theta}\log p(D\mid W)+\mathrm{KL}[q_\theta(W)\Vert p(W)]$, dropping the evidence constant independent of θ. Eq. (2) averages predictive probabilities over sampled weights; experiments approximate this integral with ten sampled networks. Input baseline r and output baseline b are distinct from weight mean μ.'),
 ('说明逐层拟合的模型角色','Explain the role of layerwise fitting',r'先固定BNN均值参数为标准DNN参数，再为输入和低层特征学习扰动协方差，使各层表征分布的KL尽可能小。相关Eq6–7在指标/拟合方法入口逐式记录。原“通常可近似”是实验建模结论，不是所有BNN与输入噪声DNN必然精确同律的数学定理。',r'First fix the standard-DNN parameters to the BNN means, then learn perturbation covariances for the input and lower-layer features to reduce layerwise representation-distribution KL. Eqs. (6)–(7) are recorded in the fitting-method entry. “Usually approximate” is a modeling and empirical conclusion, not a theorem that every BNN exactly shares a law with an input-noise DNN.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-reference','参考距离、裁剪与 Gaussian 尾部','Reference distance, clipping and Gaussian tails',r'r_i=\begin{cases}x_i-\tau&x_i>E[x_i]\\x_i+\tau&x_i\le E[x_i]\end{cases},\quad x_i-r_i=s_i\tau,\quad\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2I)',
 r'$E[x_i]$ 是训练数据的坐标均值；$\tau$ 为朝数据均值方向的参考距离，$s_i\in\{-1,1\}$。原脚注对越过均值的r裁剪，但后续理论明确忽略裁剪。',r'Here E[x_i] is the coordinate mean of training data, τ is the reference distance toward that mean, and $s_i\in\{-1,1\}$. A source footnote clips references that cross the data mean, while subsequent theory explicitly ignores that clipping.',
 '本页定义固定距离的理论模型与“小Gaussian扰动”近似，不将方差小等同绝不跨基线。','This entry defines the fixed-distance theoretical model and small-Gaussian approximation. Small variance does not mean that baseline crossing is impossible.',[
 ('保留脚注与后文简化的不同作用域','Retain the distinct footnote and simplified scopes',r'若 $x_i>E[x_i]$，脚注可用 $r_i=\max\{x_i-\tau,E[x_i]\}$；否则用 $r_i=\min\{x_i+\tau,E[x_i]\}$。裁剪后实际距离可能小于τ。作者后续忽略这一处理，理论式采用严格距离τ；重写和机器模型明确使用该简化范围。',r'For $x_i>E[x_i]$, the footnote may use $r_i=\max\{x_i-\tau,E[x_i]\}$; otherwise $r_i=\min\{x_i+\tau,E[x_i]\}$. Clipping can shorten the actual distance. The author subsequently ignores this treatment and uses exact distance τ; the rewrite and machine model explicitly adopt that simplified scope.'),
 ('区分符号保持近似与真实分布','Distinguish sign-preservation approximation from the actual law',r'作者明确忽略 $|\epsilon_i|\ge\tau$ 的极低概率事件。但任何非零Gaussian方差都有无界尾部。条件化符号保持会改变分布和矩，忽略尾部只支持近似且需要误差界。真实最低交互有符号相消，可避免这近似；J自身的奇次绝对矩不能这样替换。',r'The author explicitly neglects the low-probability event $|\epsilon_i|\ge\tau$. Every nondegenerate Gaussian nevertheless has unbounded tails. Conditioning on sign preservation changes the distribution and moments, while discarding tails supports only an approximation needing an error bound. Sign cancellation in the actual lowest dividend avoids that approximation; an odd absolute moment of J cannot be replaced in the same way.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-trigger','固定参考交互与归一化触发定义','Fixed reference dividends and normalized-trigger definitions',r'U_S=I(S\mid x),\quad C_S(x\prime)=\frac{\sum_{\pi\in Q_S}U_{S,\pi}(x\prime)J(S,\pi\mid x\prime)}{U_S}',
 r'参考输入x固定，当前输入x′变化；$U_S$ 与Taylor的 $U_{S,\pi}(x\prime)$ 不是同一个对象。$C_S$ 是源定义的实值激活函数，其二值解释限于参考输入的掩码子域。',r'The reference input x is fixed and current input x′ varies. Reference $U_S$ and Taylor coefficient $U_{S,\pi}(x\prime)$ are different objects. The source real-valued activation function C_S has a binary interpretation only on masks of the reference input.',
 '保留源比值，记录分母为零与上游Taylor条件；二值与连续重构已拆成独立数学入口。','Retain the source ratio and record zero denominators and upstream Taylor conditions. Binary masking and continuous reconstruction have separate mathematical entries.',[
 ('对齐固定系数与移动符号系数','Align fixed coefficients and moving-sign coefficients',r'当Taylor支持展开合法，分子等于当前输入的真实交互，于是 $I(S\mid x\prime)=U_SC_S(x\prime)$。在参考输入x，该分子等于 $U_S$，但只有非零域可约去成1。将每个U固定为参考值，不把U(x′)的移动sign记号混同。',r'When the Taylor support expansion is valid, the numerator is the actual current dividend and $I(S\mid x\prime)=U_SC_S(x\prime)$. At the reference input, the numerator equals U_S, but cancellation to one requires a nonzero denominator. Keep reference U fixed and distinct from moving-sign Taylor notation.'),
 ('说明零系数与回归特征的局部范围','Explain zero coefficients and the local regression-feature scope',r'即使源经验称多数交互接近零，精确零交互仍允许且使比值无定义。固定参考样本后分析回归需要固定每个C的随机函数；作者把概念学习简化为线性问题，是另外的模型假设，不等于任意原DNN权重训练轨迹。',r'Although the source reports many near-zero dividends empirically, exact zero dividends are allowed and leave the ratio undefined. Regression analysis fixes each random feature C after choosing the reference. Simplifying concept learning to a linear problem is an additional model, not an arbitrary original DNN’s weight-training trajectory.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-objective','简化随机特征回归损失','The simplified random-feature regression loss',r'\min_{\{U_S:S\in\Omega\}}L,\quad L=E_\epsilon\bigl(y^*-\sum_{S\in\Omega}U_SC_S(x+\epsilon)\bigr)^2',
 r'$x,y^*$ 是固定训练样本及输出，$\epsilon$ 是输入扰动，$\Omega$ 为概念特征族。优化变量是系数U，随机函数C在该线性模型中固定。',r'Fix training sample x, output y*, input noise ε and concept feature family Ω. Coefficients U are optimized; random functions C remain fixed in this linear model.',
 '正文把BNN训练“roughly”视为替代DNN的扰动训练，损失自身只是分析问题的定义。','The main text “roughly” treats BNN training as perturbed surrogate-DNN training. This loss is the definition of the analysis problem.',[
 ('记录损失的两个作者表达式','Record both source expressions for the loss',r'Eq15先写 $E_\epsilon(y^*-v(x\prime))^2$，再用Eq14写成上述线性系数损失，$x\prime=x+\epsilon$。两式一致需前面的连续表示有定义且支持完整；这是其来源依赖。',r'Eq. (15) first writes $E_\epsilon(y^*-v(x\prime))^2$, then uses Eq. (14) for the linear coefficient loss, with $x\prime=x+\epsilon$. Equality requires the preceding continuous representation to be defined and supported completely.'),
 ('将最优断言放在独立目标','Place the optimum claim in a separate target',r'有二阶矩时损失为非负有限积分；关于最优权重共同尺度与严格正方差域的证明见Theorem2.5入口。仅定义argmin不建立原训练过程一定达到该最优，也不建立替代分布与BNN精确同律。',r'With second moments, the loss is a finite nonnegative integral. The common-scale optimum and strictly positive-variance domain are proved in the Theorem 2.5 entry. Defining an argmin does not prove that the original training process reaches it or that the surrogate and BNN laws are exactly equal.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-metrics','阶数指标与逐层分布拟合','Order metrics and layerwise distribution fitting',r'V_{noise}^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}\operatorname{Var}_\epsilon I(S\mid x+\epsilon),\quad K_{noise}^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}\frac{|E_\epsilon I(S\mid x+\epsilon)|}{\operatorname{Var}_\epsilon I(S\mid x+\epsilon)}',
 r'$s=|S|$ 是概念阶数。$V$ 是交互方差的平均，$K$ 是均值绝对值除以方差的平均；$I_{strength}^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}|I(S\mid x)|$。权重采样版本把随机源换成 $W\sim q_\theta$。',r'The concept order is s=|S|. V averages dividend variances, K averages absolute mean divided by variance, and $I_{strength}^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}|I(S\mid x)|$. The weight-sampling version uses W~q_θ instead of input noise.',
 '原经验测量与Eq6–7替代分布拟合；稳定度需要非零方差，log-odds得分需要概率处于(0,1)。','These are empirical measurements and the surrogate-distribution fitting method of Eqs. (6)–(7). Stability needs nonzero variance, and log-odds scores need probabilities in (0,1).',[
 ('准确记录分母与原得分','Record the correct denominator and source score',r'原K的分母是Var，不是平方根。实验得分 $v(x_S)=\log[p(y=y^*\mid x_S)/(1-p(y=y^*\mid x_S))]$，BNN概率按Eq2用十个权重采样网络平均。扰动实验使用 $\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,0.05^2I)$；输入扰动与权重扰动的V/K是不同随机实验。',r'The source denominator in K is Var, not its square root. The experimental score is $v(x_S)=\log[p(y=y^*\mid x_S)/(1-p(y=y^*\mid x_S))]$. BNN probabilities average ten weight-sampled networks as in Eq. (2). Input-noise experiments use $\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,0.05^2I)$. Input-noise and weight-noise V/K are distinct random experiments.'),
 ('记录逐层特征分布拟合公式','Record the layerwise feature-distribution fit',r'Eq6给 $h^{(l)}=W^{(l)}(\cdots\Phi^{(1)}(W^{(1)}x+b^{(1)})\cdots)+b^{(l)}$，其中 $W^{(l)}\in\mathbb R^{D_l\times D_{l-1}}$、$b^{(l)}\in\mathbb R^{D_l}$，$\Phi$ 为激活门控对角矩阵。Eq7对 $1\le l\le L$ 最小化 $\mathrm{KL}(p_{BNN}(h^{(l)})\Vert p_{DNN}(\widetilde h^{(l)}\mid\Delta))$，逐层固定已学较低层的扰动协方差。图2的接近程度是数值拟合证据，不证明同律。',r'Eq. (6) gives $h^{(l)}=W^{(l)}(\cdots\Phi^{(1)}(W^{(1)}x+b^{(1)})\cdots)+b^{(l)}$, with $W^{(l)}\in\mathbb R^{D_l\times D_{l-1}}$, $b^{(l)}\in\mathbb R^{D_l}$ and diagonal activation gates $\Phi$. For $1\le l\le L$, Eq. (7) minimizes $\mathrm{KL}(p_{BNN}(h^{(l)})\Vert p_{DNN}(\widetilde h^{(l)}\mid\Delta))$, fixing already learned lower-layer perturbation covariances. Figure 2 supplies numerical fit evidence, not equality in law.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-generalization','类别交互的符号拆分与 Jaccard 泛化指标','Sign-split category dividends and Jaccard generalization metric',r'g^{(m)}=E_c\frac{\|\min(\widetilde I_{train,c}^{(m)},\widetilde I_{test,c}^{(m)})\|_1}{\|\max(\widetilde I_{train,c}^{(m)},\widetilde I_{test,c}^{(m)})\|_1}',
 r'对每个类别c及全部m阶集合 $S_1,\ldots,S_d$，向量第j项是该类别训练或测试样本的平均 $I(S_j\mid x)$。$\widetilde I=[\max(I,0)^\top,-\min(I,0)^\top]^\top\in\mathbb R_{\ge0}^{2d}$ 将正负贡献分开。',r'For class c and every order-m coalition S_1,…,S_d, vector coordinate j is the mean I(S_j|x) across that class’s training or test samples. The split $\widetilde I=[\max(I,0)^\top,-\min(I,0)^\top]^\top\in\mathbb R_{\ge0}^{2d}$ separates positive and negative contributions.',
 '原Appendix F经验泛化定义；类内样本集合非空，Jaccard分母非零。未给从训练误差到任意测试分布的概率界。','This is the empirical Appendix F metric. Class sample sets must be nonempty and the Jaccard denominator nonzero. No probability bound from training error to arbitrary test distributions is supplied.',[
 ('先构造同序概念向量','Construct concept vectors with identical coordinate order',r'训练与测试必须使用同一 $S_1,\ldots,S_d$ 和同一类别c，先对各自类内样本平均交互，再作正负拆分。这个顺序避免把平均相似度误写成逐样本比值；作者Eq18按类别平均最终sim。',r'Training and test vectors use the same ordered coalitions $S_1,\ldots,S_d$ and class c. First average dividends within each sample set, then split signs. This order avoids replacing similarity of averages by an average of samplewise ratios. Eq. (18) averages the final similarity across classes.'),
 ('按非负拆分向量计算相似度','Compute similarity from the nonnegative split vectors',r'Eq19的逐坐标min之L1和除以逐坐标max之L1和是Jaccard相似度。正负贡献在不同坐标，不会因正负抵消假装一致。若两向量均零，则分母零，源未说明赋值；它仍是定义域问题。所谓高阶更弱泛化由表格与相关研究解释，不由此指标公式推出。',r'Eq. (19) is Jaccard similarity: the L1 sum of coordinatewise minima divided by that of maxima. Opposite signed contributions occupy different coordinates and cannot cancel to simulate agreement. Two zero vectors yield a zero denominator, whose value the source does not specify. The high-order generalization interpretation relies on tables and related studies, not this metric formula alone.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-experiments','模型、扰动与概念阶数的实证比较','Empirical comparisons of models, perturbations and concept order',r'I_{strength}^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}|I(S\mid x)|',
 r'正文图1–4及附录C–F/H比较标准DNN、均场BNN与扰动替代DNN；样本、数据集、架构和训练准确率是实验控制变量。',r'Main Figures 1–4 and Appendices C–F/H compare standard DNNs, mean-field BNNs and perturbed surrogate DNNs. Samples, datasets, architectures and training accuracy are experimental control variables.',
 '有限实验配置与观察；所有正式物理页及无证明图表页保留在逐页清单。','These are finite experimental configurations and observations. Every official physical page, including figures without proofs, remains in the page inventory.',[
 ('区分三种配对比较及测量随机源','Distinguish the three paired comparisons and random sources',r'图4比较BNN与其均值DNN、标准DNN与构造的BNN、以及达到相同训练准确率的DNN/BNN。图2逐层拟合替代模型分布，图3比较输入噪声和权重噪声V/K；附录列细节、复杂度/泛化/鲁棒性相关实验。不能由一组有限图表推任意架构的普遍定理。',r'Figure 4 compares a BNN with its mean DNN, a standard DNN with a constructed BNN, and a DNN/BNN pair at equal training accuracy. Figure 2 fits layerwise surrogate distributions; Figure 3 compares V/K under input and weight noise. Appendices give configurations and related complexity, generalization and robustness experiments. These finite plots do not prove a theorem for every architecture.'),
 ('保留整体结论所依赖的近似模型','Retain the approximations underlying the overall interpretation',r'正文“BNN倾向少学复杂且敏感概念”连接分布近似、Gaussian局部模型、固定独立特征回归与经验比较。已证明的积分恒等式不会自动消除任意DNN Taylor、零系数触发、分布近似或跨阶推论的缺口，各问题明确链接到对应条目。',r'The claim that BNNs tend to learn fewer complex sensitive concepts combines distribution approximation, a local Gaussian model, fixed independent-feature regression and empirical comparisons. Proved integral identities do not automatically remove the arbitrary-DNN Taylor, zero-trigger, distribution-fit or cross-order inference gaps; each is linked to its specific entry.')],role='source_material')
add('bnn-order-inference','缩放夹逼后的近似阶数推论','Approximate order inference after the scaling bounds',r'A_{\min}K_I^{(s)}\le K_C^{(s)}\le A_{\max}K_I^{(s)}\quad\text{does not alone imply monotonicity of }K_C^{(s)}',
 r'$K_I$ 与 $K_C$ 分别是交互和触发的均值/方差比；原作者在Theorem2.6后从上下界随阶数减小说“approximately consider”中间量也减小。此处是未编号推论，与精确Eq17/60尺度界分开。',r'K_I and K_C are the mean/variance ratios of dividends and triggers. After Theorem 2.6, the author says one can “approximately consider” the middle quantity decreasing because both bounds decrease with order. This unnumbered inference is separate from the exact scaling bounds in Eqs. (17)/(60).',
 '保留源近似措辞。没有额外统一逼近误差、概念族比较结构或对任意Taylor叠加的稳定度结论。','Retain the source approximation wording. No uniform approximation error, concept-family comparison structure or stability theorem for arbitrary Taylor superpositions is supplied.',[
 ('说明夹逼实际控制的量','Explain what the sandwich bounds actually control',r'精确尺度恒等式是 $K_C=|U|K_I$，上下界只把固定概念的幅值换算控制在 $[A_{\min},A_{\max}]$。Theorem2.4处理的是满足兼容次数的单个绝对单项式支持嵌套；它不直接计算整个任意Taylor和的方差与交叉协方差。',r'The exact relation is $K_C=|U|K_I$. The sandwich bounds control the amplitude conversion of each fixed concept within $[A_{\min},A_{\max}]$. Theorem 2.4 concerns compatible nested supports of a single absolute monomial; it does not directly compute the variance and cross-covariances of an arbitrary Taylor superposition.'),
 ('核查界下降不能推出中间量单调','Check that decreasing bounds do not force the middle quantity to decrease',r'纯逻辑例：$A_{\min}=0.1,A_{\max}=0.2$，两阶 $K_I$ 从10降到9，选 $|U_1|=0.1,|U_2|=0.2$，则上下界从[1,2]降到[0.9,1.8]，但真实换算量 $K_{C,1}=1<K_{C,2}=1.8$。这说明夹逼逻辑不足，不将该辅助数值例冒充全BNN原模型的形式化反例。整体经验倾向仍依赖替代模型近似、独立固定特征假设和实验观察。',r'For a logical example, take $A_{\min}=0.1,A_{\max}=0.2$ and $K_I$ decreasing from 10 to 9. Choose $|U_1|=0.1,|U_2|=0.2$. Both bounds decrease from [1,2] to [0.9,1.8], yet $K_{C,1}=1<K_{C,2}=1.8$. This shows that the sandwich logic is insufficient; the auxiliary values are not reported as a formal counterexample to the whole BNN model. The overall empirical tendency still depends on surrogate approximation, fixed independent features and experiments.')],role='statement_scope_explanation',assessment='scope_under_review')
add('bnn-superposition-inference','单项触发到整体交互的近似推论','Approximate inference from a single trigger to the whole dividend',r'\operatorname{Var}\!\left(\sum_\pi c_\pi J_\pi\right)=\sum_{\pi,\rho}c_\pi c_\rho\operatorname{Cov}(J_\pi,J_\rho)',
 r'$J_\pi$ 是同一扰动输入上的不同次数触发，$c_\pi$ 是假定固定的展开系数。先考虑有限和和有限二阶矩；原无限Taylor和与含移动符号的系数还需各自合法条件。$|S|$ 是支持阶数，而不是不同次数项的数量。',r'The $J_\pi$ are different-degree triggers of the same perturbed input, with coefficients $c_\pi$ assumed fixed. Begin with a finite sum and finite second moments. Infinite Taylor sums and moving-sign coefficients require their own legitimate conditions. Support order $|S|$ differs from the number of terms.',
 '保留源文“usually chaotic”和“roughly consider”的近似措辞；作者未给系数概率律、协方差界或跨概念统一幅值约束。','Retain the source approximation wording “usually chaotic” and “roughly consider”. No coefficient distribution, covariance bound or uniform amplitude constraint across concepts is supplied.',[
 ('计算叠加方差所需的交叉项','Identify the cross terms required for a superposition variance',r'有限二阶矩时展开中心化和的平方，线性积分给陈述中的全部协方差和。即使每个单项的方差都增长，重叠支持使不同 $J_\pi$ 通常相关，系数符号还可改变交叉项；“chaotic”没有提供能删除它们的定量假设。源系数随输入改变时还必须把系数本身纳入随机量，不能先当常数移出积分。',r'With finite second moments, expand the square of the centered sum and integrate linearly to obtain the complete covariance sum in the statement. Increasing component variances alone does not control overlapping, generally correlated $J_\pi$ or signed cross terms. “Chaotic” supplies no quantitative condition deleting them. Moving coefficients must themselves remain inside the random variables rather than being pulled outside the integral.'),
 ('保留原近似整体解释的范围','Retain the scope of the approximate whole-dividend interpretation',r'Theorem2.4已证明的是兼容次数的单个绝对触发在嵌套支持下的增长，并未证明任意系数Taylor和的跨阶方差或稳定度单调。不同概念权重也可任意缩放其方差，故没有共同幅值条件时，不能从单项乘积式推出统一交互强弱排序。这里记录证明链缺少的条件，不把未量化近似句改成虚构的精确原定理或机器反例。',r'The repaired Theorem 2.4 compares a single absolute trigger with compatible degrees on nested supports. It does not prove cross-order monotonicity of variance or stability for arbitrary weighted Taylor sums. Arbitrary concept amplitudes also rescale variances, so single-product formulas cannot establish a universal dividend ranking without amplitude conditions. Record the missing support in the argument without replacing the unquantified approximation by an invented exact theorem or machine counterexample.')],role='statement_scope_explanation',assessment='scope_under_review')
